    <string name="faq_dialog_title">Frequently Asked Questions</string>
    <string name="faq_q1">How does real-time GPS telemetry work?</string>
    <string name="faq_a1">The school vehicle transmits its location, speed, and stop progress every few seconds while a trip is active, allowing live route monitoring.</string>
    <string name="faq_q2">What happens if the vehicle loses signal during boarding?</string>
    <string name="faq_a2">RouteGuard stores boarding records and GPS points in the local Room database and automatically syncs them once mobile signal returns.</string>
    <string name="faq_q3">How do I manage the authorized caregiver network?</string>
    <string name="faq_a3">From your parent profile you can add authorized relatives or guardians to receive boarding alerts and monitor active trips.</string>
    <string name="faq_q4">How do Stripe subscription plans and payments work?</string>
    <string name="faq_a4">School administrators can activate, upgrade, or renew institutional plans (Basic, Intermediate, or Complete) via secure Stripe Checkout.</string>
    <string name="faq_q5">How do I verify the driver\'s SOAT insurance and license?</string>
    <string name="faq_a5">In the Vehicle &amp; Safety card you can view the valid SOAT policy, technical inspection, and verified driver license (e.g., A-IIIa).</string>
